{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48084","headline":"维扬空庄四怪联句 · 不详","name":"维扬空庄四怪联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐纨鲁缟如霜雪，寥亮高声予所发。\n嘉宾良会清夜时，煌煌灯烛我能持。\n清冷之泉候朝汲，桑绠相牵常出入。\n爨薪贮泉相煎熬，充他口腹我爲劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}